{"id":"vod_sn_36535","vodId":"36535","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"欢迎来到加帕里公园第二季","name_cn":"欢迎来到加帕里公园第二季","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/31cb5b2de80cd1d9daba11966581e588.jpg"},"summary":"坐落在这个世界的某个角落的超大型综合动物园「加帕里公园」，依靠着那里的神秘物质「砂之星」的力量，动物一个个都变成了人类的模样。变身成为「兽娘」，来访的人们把她们称为「朋友（friends）」。在热闹中享受着梦幻般的时光。在加帕里公园顺利开业之前，其实有一场巨大危机。这是讲述跨越危机的朋友们和「园长」的冒险故事。担任公园向导的未来小姐和曾经参与冒险的薮猫一行，将这个故事记录了下来。救公园于危机之中的众多朋友们和「园长」出镜的乱哄哄的视频记录，你也来看看吧？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:43:59","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wZRZj1zBMG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8NMRNHLQmr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2ik3P39RAX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QdbVUaeQzR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KsFQHWisff1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/06KPuffYJx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8SeFUK30Ga1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c5BRNXEvQL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FGcedCVxwM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HGfQ04vmVh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CwFs6SKW2G1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5mKNp0d6551/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:21.949Z"}